# Phase-4 replay archive — the lagging reporter: G2's claim travels a
# congested link (300 ms injected delay); G1's claim lands while the item is
# still in the table and wins; G2's delayed claim arrives AFTER the transfer
# — refused. The winner never sees a reject.
#
# Fossil of: ItemSimulationTests.PickupRace_LaggingReporter_Loses
# Mechanism: the transfer removed the item from the table (ItemService.cs:338),
#            so the delayed claim hits the "not in the table" branch (:325-333)

@0 spawn g1 42 test_item 1.0
@33 expect host_table 42 within 500
@33 fault g2 host delay=300
@33 pickup g2 42 test_item 1.0
@33 pickup g1 42 test_item 1.0
@66 expect_no_reject g1
@366 expect reject g2 42 within 500
@366 expect no_host_table 42 within 500
